{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Do not come on the day of your disaster:</b> for he hates you, as in the matter of \"all the brothers of a poor man hate him\" (Proverbs 19:7)." "<b>A near neighbor is better:</b> that he be near to help you than a brother who is far from your disaster; therefore, do not abandon your friend."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:01.316138087Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}